Supervised clinical experience in an early childhood setting. Teacher candidates will apply principles of planning, instruction, assessment, management, and professionalism in diverse field-based settings serving students in grades P-3. Offered in Fall.', N'P', N'Pass/Fail', N'P - Pass/Fail', N'Banner Basic', NULL, NULL)
