Seminar meetings and planned excursions will facilitate scholarly exploration of nursing practice, comparing and contrasting nursing practice in
developed and developing countries with the United States. Emphasis is placed on the social determinants of health that influence disease prevention
and health.
', N'S', N'Standard Letter', N'S - Standard Letter', N'CAPP', NULL, NULL)
